OL,3,AUS envoy to meet Putin in Russia as
OL,4,AZelensky says intelligence sharing
OL,5,A'works now'
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS special envoy Steve Witkoff is set
OL,8,Fto meet Russian President Vladimir
OL,9,FPutin in St Petersburg on Wednesday to
OL,10,Fdiscuss proposals on ending Russia's
OL,11,Fyears-long conflict with Ukraine.
OL,13,FThe talks come one day after Witkoff's
OL,14,Fmeeting with Ukraine's President
OL,15,FVolodymyr Zelensky in Oslo, which a US
OL,16,Fofficial described as "constructive".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
